graph LR
    subgraph Memory Storage
        Facts[(Facts Storage)]
        Prefs[(Preferences Storage)]
        Summaries[(Summaries Storage)]
        Tasks[(Tasks Storage)]
        Rels[(Relationships Storage)]
    end

    UserMessage --> Extraction[Memory Extractor]
    Extraction --> Save[Memory Writer]
    Save --> MemoryStorage

    MemoryStorage --> Retrieval[Memory Retriever]
    Retrieval --> PromptContext[Prompt Context]
